    <div>
      <h1 id="cite-title">How to cite MaizeGDB</h1>
      <p>Citations in the literature are how we demonstrate that MaizeGDB is a useful resource. Please cite the reference below rather than linking to the site alone, which we cannot track.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="cite-primary-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="cite-primary-title">When citing MaizeGDB, please use</h2></div>
      <p>The current reference for the resource as a whole.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-cite-primary">
      <p class="mgdb-cite-primary-text" id="cite-primary-text">Margaret R Woodhouse, Ethalinda K Cannon, John L Portwood 2nd, Jack M Gardiner, Rita K Hayford, Olivia Haley, Carson M Andorf. &#40;2025&#41; Tools and Resources at the Maize Genetics and Genomics Database &#40;MaizeGDB&#41;. <i>Cold Spring Harb Protoc.</i> 2025&#40;1&#41;. doi:10.1101/pdb.over108430</p>
      <div class="mgdb-cite-primary-actions">
        <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-primary" type="button" id="cite-copy" data-copy-target="cite-primary-text">Copy citation</button>
        <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-external" href="https://doi.org/10.1101/pdb.over108430" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on doi.org<span class="mgdb-visually-hidden"> &#40;opens doi.org&#41;</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="mgdb-visually-hidden" id="cite-copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="cite-metrics-title">
